      "date": "2026-02-12T00:00:00.000Z",
      "title": "Golkunda Diamonds & Jewellery Limited announced that it expects to receive INR 69.015 million in funding from Fortune Bright Trading LLP, Invicta Finserv Private Limited, Skael Enterprise Private Limited, Ratan Corporation Private Limited, Indeed Advisory Private Limited, Shanti Gold International Limited and other individual investors.",
      "body": "Golkunda Diamonds & Jewellery Limited announced private placement to issue of 1,290,000 Convertible warrants at an issue price of INR 53.5 for gross proceeds of INR 69,015,000 on a preferential basis on February 12, 2026. The transaction includes participation from Vimal Kishore Parwal HUF for 285,000 warrants, Fortune Bright Trading LLP for 200,000 warrants, Shanti Gold International Limited for 200,000 warrants for 2.42%, Pankti Ankit Khokhani for  60,000  warrants, Invicta Finserv Pvt Ltd for 50,000  warrants, Skael Enterprise Private Limited for  50,000  warrants, D C Capital for 40,000 warrants, Ratan Corporation Private Limited for 40,000 warrants, Indeed Advisory Pvt Ltd for 25,000 warrants and includes other individual investors. The warrants will be exercised at an exercise price ",
